<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Trust ask-only in Tokyo on financing talk.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Trust ask-only in Tokyo on financing talk.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Sumitomo Trust &amp; Banking Co Ltd were ask-only in Tokyo on Wednesday on vague market rumours that the Japanese trust bank is considering equity financing worth some 100 billion yen, brokers said.</p>
<p>A bank spokesman declined to comment on the rumour, which spurred oversupply fears in the market.</p>
<p>As of 0108 GMT, the shares were ask-only at 1,170 yen, compared with its Tuesday close of 1,230.</p>
